    "display_order": null,
    "body": "---\ndoc_status: doc_review\n---\n\n# S5a app-shell hardening — review notes\n\n## Script set\n\nThe shell pins **12** CDN scripts by `sha384` and loads the Tailwind runtime from `assets/vendor/`.\n\n| Directive | Sources |\n|---|---|\n| `script-src` | `'self'`, 12 URLs, 2 inline hashes |\n| `object-src` | `'none'` |\n\n```ts\nconst policy = document.querySelector('meta[http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\"]');\n```\n\n- [x] SRI on every versioned CDN script\n- [ ] Queue nav item (S5b)"
  },
